    "text": "Winx club holds a very distinct place in my mind as a thing that sort of introduced me to something else. One Saturday after like the first ep of Winx me and my sister watched (which had this sephiroth looking guy going I didn't kill your parents they're alive somewhere)yet we both knew what it was despite never hearing about it the next in the cw4kids lineup was a show called Kamen Rider dragon knight. It was the ep where the green bull gets sent to the shadow realm I think, didn't know what that show was and thought power rangers for a long time until 2012 where on YouTube I saw a video where the pr samurai were fighting alongside some red dude who's name wasn't said out loud that was wielding the fire smasher and samurai red was holding a giant blue sword instead and they were all talking in Japanese. Then in 2012-13 I count the medals 1-2-3 life goes on everything goes coming up OOOs and finally figured out what Kamen Rider was. As for Winx the second thing I ever saw of it on tv was a movie that aired right after that ep of adventure time were this one guy wanted to score pb but she just makes an android of her for him since she knows she can't love him.",
